<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Sydney Casino shares surge at open.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Sydney Casino shares surge at open.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd surged 28 cents to A$2.21 in early trade on Monday after Kerry Packer's Publishing and Broadcasting Ltd said it planned to buy 10 percent of the Sydney-based casino and take management control.</p>
<p>PBL said in a statement it would acquire from Showboat Inc about 55 million ordinary shares or about 10 percent of Sydney Casino at A$1.85 per share and would pay a A$240 million fee for management control of the casino.</p>
</text>
